From: ysfaculty <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:44:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 150/167] hjviewer: the phone settings' Advanced settings
 header holds the codec and recording rows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1.9.1, as on the desktop: the phone settings' "Advanced" header reads
"Advanced settings" (고급 설정), and its network entry plain "Network"
(네트워크). On Android the hardware codec switch and the recording rows
(the automatic recordings and the directory) sit under that header
instead of under headers of their own; each keeps its condition. The
account, app lock, settings and About sections, and the sections an
outgoing-only build never shows, stay as they were.

Tests: the settings' order with the rows under the new header, and the
two names.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 flutter/lib/common/hjv_phone.dart           |  10 +-
 flutter/lib/mobile/pages/settings_page.dart | 138 ++++++++++----------
 flutter/test/hjviewer_phone_test.dart       |  23 +++-
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 80 deletions(-)

diff --git a/flutter/lib/common/hjv_phone.dart b/flutter/lib/common/hjv_phone.dart
index 91eb0e0..4c155e5 100644
--- a/flutter/lib/common/hjv_phone.dart
+++ b/flutter/lib/common/hjv_phone.dart
@@ -250,8 +250,10 @@ class HjvPhoneTexts {
 
   String _t(String ko, String en) => korean ? ko : en;
 
-  // the settings' sub-screen with the expert network rows (U40)
-  String get networkAdvanced => _t('네트워크(고급)', 'Network (advanced)');
-  // the settings' header over it and the display settings' row
-  String get advanced => _t('고급', 'Advanced');
+  // the settings' sub-screen with the expert network rows (U40); 1.9.1: plain "네트워크" under
+  // the 고급 설정 header
+  String get networkAdvanced => _t('네트워크', 'Network');
+  // the settings' header over it and the display settings' row; 1.9.1: 고급 설정, as the
+  // desktop's tab
+  String get advanced => _t('고급 설정', 'Advanced settings');
 }
